---
import { ArrowUpRight, Gamepad2 } from 'lucide-astro';
import type { CollectionEntry } from 'astro:content';

type Entry = CollectionEntry<'entries'>;
interface Props { games: Entry[]; }
const { games } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="content-section games-section" id="games">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="section-heading games-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">04 / GAME LAB</p><h2>游戏项目区</h2></div>
      <a class="view-all" href="/games/">查看全部游戏 <ArrowUpRight /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="games-intro">
      <div class="games-symbol"><Gamepad2 /></div>
      <p>把规则、反馈和一点点快乐做成可以玩的东西。这里放小游戏、交互实验和正在迭代的游戏原型。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="game-grid searchable-group">
      {games.map((game) => <a class="game-card searchable-item" data-search={`${game.data.title} ${game.data.description} ${game.data.label ?? ''}`} href={`/games/${game.id.replace(/\.md$/, '')}/`}>
        <div class={`project-visual visual-${game.data.visual}`}>
          {game.data.image ? <img src={game.data.image} alt={`${game.data.title} 游戏封面`} loading="lazy" width="900" height="600" /> : <span class="game-fallback-mark">PLAY</span>}
          <span class="game-play"><Gamepad2 /> 开始探索 <ArrowUpRight /></span>
        </div>
        <div class="game-info"><div><span class="project-type">{game.data.label}</span><h3>{game.data.title}</h3><p>{game.data.description}</p></div><ArrowUpRight /></div>
      </a>)}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
